So really looking at their internal world, how they regulate their emotional system, how is their distress tolerance, how impulsive are they? Are they reward seeking? Are they more driven by positive reinforcement or negative reinforcement, which means are they seeking a reward? Are they kind of going away from a negative? Are they perfectionistic? Are they trying to get this eyebrow to match, that eyebrow, which sometimes the cognitive has a

29
